{"title":"Career Roadmap · Web Analyst","role":"Web Analyst","summary":"A Web Analyst measures how people discover, navigate and interact with websites and digital products, then converts that data into recommendations that improve traffic, engagement, conversion, retention and revenue.","facts":{"Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM (Bachelor of Business Administration / Management Studies)","Course":"BBA – Digital Marketing"},"about":[{"label":"Start","text":"Year 1 UG · 2026"},{"label":"Typical first step","text":"Digital Analytics Intern / Web Analytics Intern / Marketing Analytics Intern"},{"label":"Long-term direction","text":"Web Analyst → Digital/Marketing Analyst → Senior Analyst → Analytics Lead/Manager"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"Digital Analytics Intern, Web Analytics Intern, Marketing Analytics Intern"},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"How should I specialise?","output":"Web Analyst → Digital/Marketing Analyst → Senior Analyst"},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Digital Analytics Lead, Product Analyst, CRO Specialist, Analytics Manager"},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How can I remain relevant?","output":"Head of Digital Analytics, Growth Analytics Leader, Decision Intelligence Lead"}],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The role sits at the intersection of digital marketing + analytics + consumer behaviour + technology. A BBA Digital Marketing student can enter this field directly by developing strong capabilities in web analytics platforms, SQL, Excel, Power BI, statistics, experimentation, SEO/SEM analytics and data storytelling."}]},{"heading":"Career-route check","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["BBA Digital Marketing","Digital Analytics Internship","Web Analyst","Digital/Marketing Analyst","Senior Web Analyst","Digital Analytics Lead/Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"This is a strong alignment, provided the student develops more than marketing knowledge. The differentiator is the ability to work with actual behavioural data and translate it into measurable business improvements."},{"type":"note","label":"Timeline assumption","text":"A 4-year undergraduate programme beginning in 2026 is assumed, with graduation around 2030."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"These are planning horizons, not guaranteed promotion timelines."}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Digital marketing + Excel + business metrics"},{"text":"University + Microsoft Excel"},{"text":"Website KPI workbook"},{"text":"Business foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Web fundamentals + SEO + basic statistics"},{"text":"University + NPTEL"},{"text":"Website audit"},{"text":"Digital foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Web analytics + event/funnel concepts"},{"text":"Official analytics learning resources"},{"text":"Analytics measurement plan"},{"text":"Measurement capability"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"SQL + Power BI + dashboarding"},{"text":"SQLBolt + Microsoft"},{"text":"Website analytics dashboard"},{"text":"Technical analytics"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Python + pandas + deeper statistics"},{"text":"Python + pandas + NPTEL"},{"text":"Web-data EDA project"},{"text":"Advanced analytics"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Internship + CRO/experimentation"},{"text":"Industry + practical projects"},{"text":"Internship + case study"},{"text":"Business application"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Attribution + forecasting + product analytics"},{"text":"Advanced projects"},{"text":"End-to-end digital analytics project"},{"text":"Strategic analytics"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"Portfolio + interviews + capstone"},{"text":"GitHub + mock interviews"},{"text":"5–8 strong projects"},{"text":"Employability"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful foundations include Microsoft Excel, SQLBolt, Python documentation and pandas.","url":"https://www.microsoft.com/microsoft-365/excel"},{"type":"h","text":"Core Web Analytics Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Digital marketing fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"SEM/PPC"},{"text":"Social media marketing"},{"text":"Email marketing"},{"text":"Affiliate marketing"},{"text":"Content marketing"},{"text":"Display advertising"},{"text":"E-commerce marketing"},{"text":"Conversion optimisation"},{"text":"Customer acquisition"},{"text":"Retention"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Web analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Users"},{"text":"Sessions"},{"text":"Page views"},{"text":"Engagement"},{"text":"Traffic sources"},{"text":"Landing pages"},{"text":"Exit behaviour"},{"text":"Events"},{"text":"Conversions"},{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"Funnel analysis"},{"text":"Cohort analysis"},{"text":"User journeys"},{"text":"Campaign measurement"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Avoid treating any metric in isolation. For example, increasing traffic is not necessarily an improvement if conversion rate, customer quality or revenue declines."},{"type":"h","text":"3. Analytics implementation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the concepts behind:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Event tracking"},{"text":"Conversion tracking"},{"text":"UTM parameters"},{"text":"Campaign tagging"},{"text":"Measurement plans"},{"text":"Data-layer concepts"},{"text":"Tag management"},{"text":"Cross-domain measurement"},{"text":"Consent/privacy considerations"},{"text":"Data quality validation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Data and BI"},{"type":"p","text":"Build proficiency in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"DAX fundamentals"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"Basic databases"},{"text":"Data visualisation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Microsoft Power BI","url":"https://www.microsoft.com/power-platform/products/power-bi"},{"type":"h","text":"5. Statistics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mean/median"},{"text":"Variance"},{"text":"Standard deviation"},{"text":"Distributions"},{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Confidence intervals"},{"text":"Correlation"},{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"Hypothesis testing"},{"text":"A/B testing"},{"text":"Statistical significance"},{"text":"Effect size"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A/B testing should not be reduced to simply asking whether one version \"won\"; understand sample size, statistical uncertainty, practical significance and experiment design."},{"type":"h","text":"Website Metrics You Should Master"},{"type":"table","header":["Area","Metrics"],"rows":[[{"text":"Acquisition"},{"text":"Users, sessions, source/medium, campaign traffic"}],[{"text":"Engagement"},{"text":"Engagement rate, time-related metrics, pages/views, events"}],[{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"Conversion rate, leads, purchases, funnel completion"}],[{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Revenue, average order value, product conversion"}],[{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Returning users, cohorts, repeat purchases"}],[{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"Impressions, clicks, CTR, rankings, landing-page performance"}],[{"text":"Paid marketing"},{"text":"CPC, CPM, CTR, CPA, ROAS"}],[{"text":"Product"},{"text":"Activation, feature adoption, retention, funnel drop-off"}],[{"text":"Business"},{"text":"CAC, LTV, revenue per visitor, margin-related outcomes"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Portfolio Projects"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, target 8–10 strong projects."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Website Performance Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Traffic"},{"text":"Acquisition channels"},{"text":"Landing pages"},{"text":"Engagement"},{"text":"Conversions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — E-commerce Funnel Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Landing page","Product view","Add to cart","Checkout","Purchase"]},{"type":"p","text":"Identify where users drop out."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — SEO Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Search traffic"},{"text":"Landing pages"},{"text":"CTR"},{"text":"Search visibility"},{"text":"Content performance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Marketing Campaign Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Compare campaigns using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CTR"},{"text":"CPC"},{"text":"CPA"},{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"ROAS"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Customer Cohort Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Compare customer behaviour across acquisition periods."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — A/B Testing Case Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse two hypothetical landing pages and determine whether the difference is statistically and practically meaningful."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 7 — Web Analytics + SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Build SQL queries answering:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Which channels produce the most conversions?"},{"text":"Which pages have the highest exit rates?"},{"text":"Which customer segments have the highest revenue?"},{"text":"Which campaigns generate repeat customers?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 8 — Power BI Digital Analytics Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Combine acquisition, engagement and conversion data."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 9 — Python Web Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Use pandas to analyse synthetic or public web-event data."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 10 — End-to-End CRO Project"},{"type":"flow","items":["Problem","Data","Funnel","Hypothesis","Experiment","Result","Recommendation"]},{"type":"p","text":"This is particularly valuable for Web Analyst interviews."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation Options"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Learn from","Senior role it can lead to"],"rows":[[{"text":"Web Analytics"},{"text":"Web analytics + SQL + BI"},{"text":"Analytics projects"},{"text":"Senior Web Analyst"}],[{"text":"Digital Marketing Analytics"},{"text":"SEO/SEM + analytics + BI"},{"text":"Digital projects"},{"text":"Digital Analytics Manager"}],[{"text":"Conversion Rate Optimisation"},{"text":"Funnels + A/B testing + UX"},{"text":"Experimentation projects"},{"text":"CRO Lead"}],[{"text":"Product Analytics"},{"text":"SQL + funnels + experimentation"},{"text":"Product projects"},{"text":"Product Analytics Lead"}],[{"text":"SEO Analytics"},{"text":"SEO + search data + SQL"},{"text":"SEO projects"},{"text":"SEO Analytics Lead"}],[{"text":"E-commerce Analytics"},{"text":"Funnel + customer + revenue analytics"},{"text":"E-commerce projects"},{"text":"E-commerce Analytics Manager"}],[{"text":"Marketing Attribution"},{"text":"Campaign data + statistics + modelling"},{"text":"Analytics projects"},{"text":"Marketing Analytics Lead"}],[{"text":"Customer Analytics"},{"text":"Segmentation + cohorts + SQL"},{"text":"Customer projects"},{"text":"Customer Analytics Manager"}],[{"text":"Growth Analytics"},{"text":"Acquisition + activation + retention"},{"text":"Growth experiments"},{"text":"Growth Analytics Lead"}],[{"text":"AI/Decision Analytics"},{"text":"Python + AI + statistics + BI"},{"text":"Applied projects"},{"text":"Decision Intelligence Lead"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Four-Year Honours / Research Variant"},{"type":"p","text":"If the BBA offers a fourth-year honours/research route, use it for a deeper study such as:"},{"type":"h","text":"“Identifying the factors influencing e-commerce conversion rates using behavioural data.”"},{"type":"p","text":"The project can combine:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Web-event data"},{"text":"Funnel analysis"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"},{"text":"Statistical testing"},{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"A/B testing"},{"text":"Conversion modelling"},{"text":"Business recommendations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective should be to demonstrate analytical reasoning, not simply produce a dashboard."},{"type":"h","text":"Evolve and Stay Relevant, 2035–2046"},{"type":"p","text":"Basic dashboard production and routine reporting are increasingly automatable."},{"type":"p","text":"The future Web Analyst should therefore move toward:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Measurement","Diagnosis","Experimentation","Prediction","Decision"]},{"type":"p","text":"Develop expertise in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product analytics"},{"text":"Customer data"},{"text":"Experimentation"},{"text":"Causal inference"},{"text":"Marketing attribution"},{"text":"AI-assisted analytics"},{"text":"Predictive modelling"},{"text":"Personalisation"},{"text":"Privacy-aware measurement"},{"text":"Decision intelligence"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest long-term profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Digital Marketing","Web Analytics","Statistics","SQL","BI","Experimentation","AI"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Government / Public-Sector / Research"},{"type":"table","header":["Organisation / ecosystem","Relevant exposure"],"rows":[[{"text":"NITI Aayog","url":"https://www.niti.gov.in/"},{"text":"Digital/data-driven policy work"}],[{"text":"Ministry of Statistics & Programme Implementation","url":"https://www.mospi.gov.in/"},{"text":"Data and statistical analysis"}],[{"text":"Government digital initiatives"},{"text":"Digital adoption and user analytics"}],[{"text":"Universities / IITs / IIMs"},{"text":"Consumer/digital research"}],[{"text":"Public-sector enterprises"},{"text":"Digital marketing and business analytics"}],[{"text":"PM Internship Scheme"},{"text":"Industry exposure, subject to current eligibility"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"PM Internship Scheme","url":"https://pminternship.mca.gov.in/"},{"type":"h","text":"Private-sector internships"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Web Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Marketing Analytics Intern"},{"text":"SEO Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Growth Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Performance Marketing Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Product Analytics Intern"},{"text":"E-commerce Analytics Intern"},{"text":"CRO Intern"},{"text":"Business Analytics Intern"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Good industry categories include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital agencies"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"SaaS"},{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"EdTech"},{"text":"Travel"},{"text":"Retail"},{"text":"FMCG"},{"text":"Media"},{"text":"Advertising"},{"text":"Consumer technology"},{"text":"Consulting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship evidence should include"},{"type":"p","text":"Instead of writing only:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"Worked on Google Analytics.\""},{"type":"p","text":"Show:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"Analysed acquisition and conversion data for X website, identified funnel drop-offs, built a dashboard and proposed three conversion improvements.\""},{"type":"p","text":"Quantifiable evidence is much stronger."}]},{"heading":"Certifications in Demand","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Certification / learning area","Purpose"],"rows":[[{"text":"Web analytics platform training"},{"text":"Measurement and reporting"}],[{"text":"Google Analytics learning/certification"},{"text":"Web analytics fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Google Ads learning"},{"text":"Paid acquisition analytics"}],[{"text":"SEO certification/training"},{"text":"Organic search analysis"}],[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Data preparation"}],[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Querying behavioural data"}],[{"text":"Power BI / PL-300 preparation"},{"text":"Business intelligence"}],[{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Analytical validity"}],[{"text":"Python + pandas"},{"text":"Advanced analysis"}],[{"text":"A/B testing / experimentation"},{"text":"CRO and product analytics"}],[{"text":"Digital marketing analytics"},{"text":"Marketing performance"}],[{"text":"AI for analytics"},{"text":"Modern analytical workflows"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Certificate availability and pricing change, so verify the current official offering before listing a credential as mandatory."}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Direct entry roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Web Analyst"},{"text":"Web Analytics Analyst"},{"text":"Digital Analytics Analyst"},{"text":"Digital Marketing Analyst"},{"text":"Marketing Analyst"},{"text":"Marketing Analytics Associate"},{"text":"Analytics Associate"},{"text":"Business Analyst"},{"text":"Data Analyst"},{"text":"Junior Data Analyst"},{"text":"SEO Analyst"},{"text":"SEO Analytics Executive"},{"text":"CRO Analyst"},{"text":"Growth Analyst"},{"text":"Product Analyst"},{"text":"E-commerce Analyst"},{"text":"Customer Insights Analyst"},{"text":"Performance Marketing Analyst"},{"text":"Digital Insights Analyst"},{"text":"Reporting Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Role-to-skill mapping"},{"type":"table","header":["Role","Stack the posting asks for","Where the student proves it"],"rows":[[{"text":"Web Analyst"},{"text":"Web analytics + Excel + SQL + BI"},{"text":"Website analytics portfolio"}],[{"text":"Digital Analyst"},{"text":"Marketing + analytics + BI"},{"text":"Campaign dashboard"}],[{"text":"Marketing Analyst"},{"text":"Marketing + statistics + analytics"},{"text":"Campaign analysis"}],[{"text":"SEO Analyst"},{"text":"SEO + search analytics"},{"text":"SEO case study"}],[{"text":"CRO Analyst"},{"text":"Funnels + A/B testing + UX"},{"text":"CRO project"}],[{"text":"Growth Analyst"},{"text":"Acquisition + retention + experimentation"},{"text":"Growth case"}],[{"text":"Product Analyst"},{"text":"SQL + product metrics + experimentation"},{"text":"Product funnel project"}],[{"text":"E-commerce Analyst"},{"text":"Revenue + customer + funnel analytics"},{"text":"E-commerce project"}],[{"text":"Data Analyst"},{"text":"SQL + Python + statistics"},{"text":"Python/SQL portfolio"}],[{"text":"BI Analyst"},{"text":"SQL + Power BI + DAX"},{"text":"BI dashboard"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Career reality"},{"type":"p","text":"The exact title \"Web Analyst\" is not used uniformly across employers. Similar work may appear under Digital Analyst, Web Analytics Analyst, Marketing Analyst, Digital Insights Analyst, Growth Analyst or Product Analyst."},{"type":"p","text":"Therefore, students should search across the broader digital analytics job family rather than limiting applications to one title."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["PG route","Best suited for"],"rows":[[{"text":"MBA Digital Marketing"},{"text":"Digital strategy and marketing leadership"}],[{"text":"MBA Marketing Analytics"},{"text":"Marketing + analytics"}],[{"text":"MBA Business Analytics"},{"text":"Analytics + management"}],[{"text":"MBA Product Management"},{"text":"Product/growth direction"}],[{"text":"MBA Strategy"},{"text":"Business strategy and consulting"}],[{"text":"M.Com Marketing / Management"},{"text":"Commerce + marketing"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Business Analytics"},{"text":"Advanced analytics"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Data Science"},{"text":"Technical analytics"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Statistics"},{"text":"Statistical depth"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Marketing Analytics / Consumer Analytics"},{"text":"Customer insights"}],[{"text":"MCA"},{"text":"Technical transition"}],[{"text":"PG Diploma in Digital/Data Analytics"},{"text":"Specialised skill development"}],[{"text":"PhD"},{"text":"Research/academic career"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Best choice by career objective"},{"type":"p","text":"Want marketing leadership?\n→ MBA Marketing / Digital Marketing"},{"type":"p","text":"Want analytics leadership?\n→ MBA Business Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Want deeper technical analytics?\n→ M.Sc Data Science / Statistics / Business Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Want product analytics?\n→ MBA Product Management / Business Analytics + strong SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Want research?\n→ M.Sc + PhD in an appropriate quantitative/business discipline"}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad — Country by Country","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Country","Example universities / ecosystem","Scholarship route","Gate to check"],"rows":[[{"text":"USA"},{"text":"Carnegie Mellon, NYU, University of Washington, UT Austin ecosystem"},{"text":"University funding, assistantships, Fulbright"},{"text":"Quantitative prerequisites"}],[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Imperial, Warwick, Manchester, Edinburgh"},{"text":"University scholarships, Chevening where eligible"},{"text":"Programme requirements"}],[{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"TUM, Mannheim, LMU ecosystem"},{"text":"DAAD + university funding"},{"text":"Degree/quantitative fit"}],[{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Toronto, UBC, Waterloo, McGill"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Programme prerequisites"}],[{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Melbourne, UNSW, Monash, ANU"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Academic + English requirements"}],[{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Erasmus University Rotterdam, Tilburg, Amsterdam"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Quantitative/business requirements"}],[{"text":"Singapore"},{"text":"NUS, NTU, SMU"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Academic profile + programme fit"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful official scholarship resources:"},{"type":"p","text":"USIEF / Fulbright-Nehru\nDAAD India","url":"https://www.usief.org.in/"},{"type":"h","text":"Application profile"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strong BBA grades"},{"text":"Web analytics projects"},{"text":"SQL portfolio"},{"text":"Power BI dashboards"},{"text":"Python/statistics project"},{"text":"Internship"},{"text":"Research/capstone project"},{"text":"Strong SOP"},{"text":"Academic recommendations"},{"text":"English test where required"},{"text":"GRE/GMAT only if required or useful for the selected programme"}]}]},{"heading":"Going Forward","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA Digital Marketing Student","Digital/Web Analytics Intern","Web Analyst / Digital Analyst / Marketing Analyst","Senior Web/Digital Analyst","Digital Analytics Lead / Growth Analytics Lead","Analytics Manager","Head of Digital Analytics / Growth Analytics / Decision Intelligence"]},{"type":"p","text":"An alternative path is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Web Analyst","Product Analyst","Senior Product Analyst","Product Analytics Lead","Product Analytics Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"PhD Directions"},{"type":"p","text":"A Web Analyst who develops strong quantitative and research capabilities can eventually pursue research in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital Marketing Analytics"},{"text":"Marketing Science"},{"text":"Consumer Behaviour"},{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"Data Science"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Econometrics"},{"text":"Information Systems"},{"text":"Human-Computer Interaction"},{"text":"Product Analytics"},{"text":"Customer Analytics"},{"text":"Digital Commerce"},{"text":"Decision Science"},{"text":"Artificial Intelligence"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2040–2046 Career Evolution"},{"type":"p","text":"By the 2040s, a strong Web Analytics professional should not position themselves merely as a website reporting specialist."},{"type":"p","text":"The more durable profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Digital Behaviour","Analytics","Experimentation","AI","Business Strategy"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The professional should be able to answer:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Where are users coming from?"},{"text":"What are they doing?"},{"text":"Where are they dropping off?"},{"text":"Why might they be dropping off?"},{"text":"What intervention should we test?"},{"text":"Did the intervention actually work?"},{"text":"Did it improve business outcomes?"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["reporting","insight","experimentation","growth","strategic decision-making"],"label":"That progression moves the career from"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong BBA Digital Marketing graduate targeting Web Analyst should ideally have:"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"SEM/PPC"},{"text":"Content"},{"text":"Campaign measurement"},{"text":"Conversion optimisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Web analytics"},{"text":"Funnel analysis"},{"text":"Cohort analysis"},{"text":"A/B testing"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Customer analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"Data visualisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Customer acquisition"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Unit economics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Future"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted analytics"},{"text":"Predictive analytics"},{"text":"Marketing attribution"},{"text":"Product analytics"},{"text":"Causal inference"},{"text":"Decision intelligence"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["8–10 meaningful projects","1–2 internships","1 end-to-end digital analytics capstone."],"sep":"+","label":"Portfolio target"}]}]}